    "description": "Title:\nHemingray Glass Insulators Clear 5 Piece Set Telephone Pole Collectible\nBrand:\nHemingray\nDepartment:\nAdults\nCondition:\nUsed\nCondition Description:\nUsed - shows some wear and discoloration\nColor:\nClear\nCategory:\nCollectibles & Art\nType:\nGlass Telephone Insulator\nCare Instructions:\nHand wash recommended\nCountry Of Origin:\nUnited States\nFeatures:\nEmbossed markings\nGlassware Type:\nUtility Glass\nMaterial:\nGlass\nNumber Of Items In Set:\n5\nSet Includes:\n5 insulators\nShape:\nRound\nUnit Quantity:\n5\nUnit Type:\nUnit\nDescription:\nElevate your decor or antique collection with this set of 5 vintage clear glass telephone pole insulators. Each piece features classic rounded shapes, thick glass construction, and embossed markings showing the 'Hemingray' name an iconic detail for collectors. The insulators show minor discoloration and wear consistent with age and previously serving functional use on utility poles. Offered as a matching set, these utility glass insulators bring industrial charm to any shelf or workspace. The heavyweight material ensures durability, while the transparency highlights their utilitarian design and historic appeal. Whether used for upcycling, display, or as conversation pieces, these insulators are a practical addition to any vintage decor. All five insulators are in used condition, with visible signs of prior use such as minor dirt, clouding, and scratches. Please review the images for individual characteristics and overall visual condition.",
